{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "809ed5fcaf1766a6ffb7796dc4c75bf46f0c31cab64c533b9dc151d87bc08caf", "ja": "ふたりはバーに来ていた。セクシービースト\nの存在に危機感を募らせる莉緒。「セクシー\nは、人と張り合うものじゃないわ」と、なだ\nめるこのみ。仕事で遅れていたプロデューサ\nーも合流し、今夜は飲み明かす事に。", "zh": "两人来到了酒吧。面对“性感\n野兽”的存在，莉绪越来越感到危机。“性感\n并不是用来和别人争高下的哦。”这个\n在工作中迟到的制作人也赶来汇合，三人决定\n今晚喝个痛快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "efeba6c300d8cd2a5ba13bcb82ca152e2408a59f233bb4db9eb51448ff53f9dc", "ja": "（このみさんと莉緒はセクシーを見つめ直す旅に出た。\n俺も残りの仕事を終えたら合流する予定だけど……）", "zh": "（このみ小姐和莉绪踏上了重新审视性感的旅程。我也打算做完剩下的工作后赶过去，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "c407a0547899401c94b866cff7fceab75293f66e31d367d6d1ea1329535829fa", "ja": "ハウスワインの赤、グラス追加でー！", "zh": "再来一杯红葡萄酒——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "1d6f1c480f3c4e1f29bf33dba5b00c2f97c9d22d7e33ba8802edbf4c85e45296", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、莉緒ちゃん！\nさっきから飲むペースが早いんじゃない？", "zh": "等一下等一下，莉绪！\n你从刚才开始喝得也太快了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "da4aad745125f0f0177787a06902eb1a04c0ba6e95e21c76fa83143fc340a42b", "ja": "だって～、飲まなきゃやってられないじゃない！", "zh": "可是～不喝点酒的话，根本撑不下去嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "7cfef09f38578561095dd10010f943b94afe27baee22c8727c349723d7fe9f4c", "ja": "{$P$}くんったら、\nデレデレ鼻の下伸ばしちゃってさ……。", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生，竟然一脸色眯眯的，鼻子都伸长了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "be9d172bf66ed0f833b5b48622f9f71a49be9eaefd9b5faddeea20c45a37446c", "ja": "ああ～、もう！　思い出したら、\nまたモヤモヤしてきちゃったじゃない！　ううっ……。", "zh": "啊啊～真是的！一想起来，\n心里又开始闷闷不乐了！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "962d8478ff1f54180ced341afb9fff9de1d474615a7194cab2cd0c60b5c7b78b", "ja": "まあでも、あれは仕方ないわよ……。セクシーの\n伝道師である私たちでさえ、目を奪われたわけだし。", "zh": "不过也是，那也是没办法的呀……毕竟就连身为性感\n传道师的我们，都被夺去了目光呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "c2a211263ee4106af1e41f393b4ad44aa8bb019a7c2c9b16ed3793d7105b3d3b", "ja": "でもね、詩花ちゃんにも言ったけど……セクシーは\n本来、自分との戦い。人と張り合うものじゃないわ。", "zh": "不过呢，我也跟诗花说过……性感本来就是与自己的战斗，不是拿来和别人较劲的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "072795232baddf3d579d9a08037effcdda2260747ebb94006cde37834b923116", "ja": "このみ姉さん……。\nそうね……たしかに、そうなんだけど……。", "zh": "琴美姐……。\n是啊……确实是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "b6574135fc9acc471adad0af72a9b1294003b181869ab8a379f042bcbb6dacb0", "ja": "それに、{$P$}が言ってたでしょ？\nビーストと私たちじゃ、セクシーの種類が違うって。", "zh": "而且，{$P$}不是说过吗？\n野兽和我们之间，性感的类型是不一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "6cf1f84974b2b041b87f45650aa31b0cf4a5e8b34ee1341ac2e58fe2afd1344d", "ja": "あっちは確かに、すごく刺激的よ？　\nでもね、なんだか、それだけに思えたっていうか……。", "zh": "那边确实非常刺激哦？\n不过呢，总觉得好像也就只有这一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "c486cdea76c4d9266d861cfa265defbf97ef5de61f7fa45cd33ac052da722a97", "ja": "このみ姉さん……それ、どういうこと？\n刺激的なセクシー、最強じゃない！　何がダメなの？", "zh": "好美姐……你这是什么意思？\n刺激十足的性感不是最强的吗！到底有什么不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "43806a4848194bbebaa35d122353f6278a032767d024101a7ca84b718a92d2ee", "ja": "ダメじゃないけど……だって私たち、アイドルでしょ？\nギラギラだけじゃなくて、キラキラしてなくちゃ！", "zh": "不是说不好啦……可是，我们是偶像吧？  \n不能光是耀眼夺目，还得闪闪发光才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "5a52b54cdaba74c95eeff6f1896b543be42abc8cabd5c3bb9368db2991c98169", "ja": "ギラギラだけじゃなくて、キラキラ……。\nはあ……やっぱり、このみ姉さんはすごいわね。", "zh": "不能只有耀眼夺目，还要闪闪发光……。\n唉……果然，这个み姐姐真厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "aed3e86b7b887a57fab8cbc54e86ca07f129a86e3357f8ff8411ba02439f44e5", "ja": "（思ったより来るのが遅くなったな……。\nええと、このみさんと莉緒は……あ、いたいた）", "zh": "（没想到来得比预想中还晚……呃，这美也小姐和莉绪……啊，在那儿在那儿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "da447f859d2aec0773a676d4a94c7a8279e833331e10839a4392534669218773", "ja": "このみさん、莉緒！\n遅くなってすみません……ん？", "zh": "这个美姐姐，莉绪！\n抱歉来晚了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
