{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "cae05b37c255b521c501f893bdae4e1ae82091f213cd5f4e46a048afcf055cf6", "ja": "だって、そうでしょ？　私が毎日自分を磨いてるのは、\n綺麗になりたい、セクシーになりたいからだもん……。", "zh": "因为，确实是这样吧？我每天努力提升自己，\n就是因为想变得更漂亮、更性感啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "7366a988e17e80874f3183a738c4b2ef0ce82e8cd78a16f6a3404ebcce0677c6", "ja": "うん……そうね。莉緒ちゃんは、\nそのために毎日頑張ってるんですものね。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。莉绪就是为了这个，每天都在努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "e10672a91ad2dde793dcd23cc146e42a9040d73047de676903d0d6596f2b2886", "ja": "そうよ～？　ファンのみんなが、セクシーな私に\nドキドキしてくれたら、すごくうれしいなって……。", "zh": "对呀～？要是粉丝们都因为性感的我而心跳加速，我会特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1020_046rio", "source_sha256": "51bf480b4f01105f10d6915870be825ba6b6595e9e9a30ffe02ebc9003317470", "ja": "アイドルなんだし、キラキラも必要だけど……。\nでも私、刺激的なセクシーも追い求めてみたい……。", "zh": "毕竟是偶像，也需要闪闪发光的一面……  \n不过，我也想追求一下令人心动的性感……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "6326a310a2a2d3b88f9d3b43d28a77ddae0b134018be4cecf15fb14a2c9ac025", "ja": "そういうのは、ダメなのかしら……？", "zh": "那样不行吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "a7c6955551857ee3f6d91cec26fbeeaccf5efe92b4372b2b56ef905db5ff9701", "ja": "そうね、ダメじゃないとは思うけど、難しいわね。\nでも……だからこそ私たちで、挑戦してみなくちゃね？", "zh": "是啊，我觉得也不是不行，但确实很难呢。  \n不过……正因为如此，我们才更要亲自挑战一下，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "d5f42d958a90c06f04f2ff6d393625b173aae9a3365aa2ec648ab7c043c1f25a", "ja": "このみ姉さん……！　ううっ、大好き～！　やっぱり\n私をわかってくれるのは、このみ姉さんだけね！", "zh": "木实姐……！呜呜，好喜欢你～！果然，懂我的只有木实姐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "21e2961041b0ed0a90a911d13bf08287cce2f5acefe16694d272543c748e9c5b", "ja": "あら、そんなことないわよ莉緒ちゃん。\n……そうでしょ、{$P$}？", "zh": "哎呀，才没那回事呢莉绪。\n……对吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "1900dfaa45792c01fadbfcc7ebf9bfb977928294ceb2fe863f8f8b28d66279d0", "ja": "……はい。そういう莉緒の気持ちは、\n一応、わかってるつもりです。", "zh": "……是的。莉绪的这种心情，\n我自认多多少少还是明白的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0110_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0110_story_04_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "d4ce35dff262ac32e90b9f4a1bc8a6009370dd7b21d1408df46b6283d43ed5c0", "ja": "え？　……や、やだ～！\n{$P$}くん、いつからいたの！？", "zh": "咦？……不、不要啦～！\n{$P$}，你什么时候来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
